  "description": "Zero-copy interop between NumSharp NDArray and ONNX Runtime (Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime) tensors. Feed an NDArray to InferenceSession.Run as an OrtValue over the very same unmanaged buffer (no per-pixel fill loop, no copy), read outputs back as NDArrays (copy or zero-copy view), and post-process with NumSharp (softmax, argmax, top-k, clip) instead of hand-written loops. Conversion library only: no engine backend, no ModuleInitializer, no native dependency of its own — bring the ONNX Runtime native package (CPU, Gpu, DirectML, ...) you already use.",
